---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="About — Super Flow">
  <main class="container section about">
    <span class="eyebrow">about</span>
    <h1>Typing is the bottleneck.<br />Speaking is the fix.</h1>

    <p data-reveal>
      Super Flow exists because typing slows down thinking. The fastest writers we
      know dictate first and edit second — but every existing tool either ships
      transcripts full of <em>um</em>, <em>like</em>, and run-on sentences, or
      leaves you copy-pasting between a recorder and your editor.
    </p>
    <p data-reveal>
      Super Flow puts polished prose directly into whatever app you are focused on.
      Press <kbd>F9</kbd>, speak, release. The text that appears reads like you wrote
      it carefully — because behind the scenes we remove fillers, fix grammar, match
      your tone, and respect the context (code editor vs Slack vs documents).
    </p>
    <p data-reveal>
      We are small, built in the open, and care more about getting out of your way
      than about adding features. If you have a feature request or a bug, write to
      us — we read everything.
    </p>

    <div class="contact-block" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">contact</span>
      <p class="contact-line">
        <a href="mailto:hello@superflow.app">hello@superflow.app</a>
        <span class="sep">·</span>
        <a href="https://github.com/man-vu/super-flow-releases">github.com/man-vu</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .about { max-width: 720px; }
  .about > p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .contact-block {
    margin-top: var(--space-7);
    padding-top: var(--space-5);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .contact-line {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .contact-line a { color: var(--accent); }
  .contact-line a:hover { color: var(--accent-hover); }
  .sep { color: var(--text-tertiary); margin: 0 8px; }
</style>
